' docs/04_uml/seq_submission_integrity.puml
@startuml
title Examory - Submission and academic integrity review
actor Student
boundary Web
participant files
participant assignments
queue Kafka
participant "ML integrity" as Integrity
participant grading
actor Teacher

note over Web, grading
  API calls use authenticated, authorized access via Nginx (omitted).
  Events use event_id, event_type, version, occurred_at, producer,
  actor {user_id, role}, context {course_id, group_id, session_id}, payload.
  Message details beyond the brief are proposed contracts.
end note
Student -> Web : Submit assignment with text/code files
Web -> files : Upload permitted files
files --> Web : Authorized file references
Web -> assignments : Create Submission with file references
assignments --> Web : Accepted submission_id and submitted_at
Web --> Student : Submission accepted; checks pending
assignments -> Kafka : submission.created
note right of Kafka
  Payload: submission_id, assignment_id, attempt,
  kind, files, submitted_at, deadline_at.
  Topic: lms.submissions.
end note
Kafka -> Integrity : submission.created
Integrity -> files : Read authorized submission content
files --> Integrity : Content
alt Integrity check succeeds and produces a risk signal
  Integrity -> Kafka : risk.plagiarism
  note right of Integrity
    Payload: risk_id, target_id = submission_id,
    score, level, explanation, evidence.
  end note
  Kafka -> grading : risk.plagiarism
  grading -> grading : Store risk beside Submission; status = pending
  Teacher -> Web : Open Submission and risk evidence
  Web -> grading : Read authorized risk and grade details
  grading --> Web : Explanation, evidence and review status
  Web --> Teacher : Show risk as a signal requiring review
  Teacher -> Web : Confirm or dismiss; enter reason
  Web -> grading : Record Teacher review
  grading -> Kafka : risk.reviewed
  note right of grading
    Proposed review payload: risk_id, target_id,
    decision, reason, reviewed_by, reviewed_at.
    Confirm/dismiss does not automatically change a grade.
  end note
  grading --> Web : Review saved
  Web --> Teacher : Updated review status
else No risk is reported
  note over Integrity, grading : No automatic allegation; absence of a signal is not proof of integrity.
else Check unavailable or delayed
  note over Web, Integrity : Accepted Submission remains valid; no automatic penalty or grade change.
end
@enduml
